## Important Conventions

- **Every experiment produces a written artifact** - Verbal-only findings are incomplete
- **Documentation during iteration, not after** - Update docs as you work
- **Benchmark claims require artifacts** - Reference specific result files and run labels
- **Default to private** - Models are private until explicit release review
- **Pin all dependencies** - No unpinned versions in requirements files
- **Config over code** - Hyperparameters in YAML, not hardcoded in scripts
- **Seeds everywhere** - Set random seeds in every training script
